        <dc:title>The Sublime Attitudes: A Study Guide on the Brahmavihāras</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Brahmavihāras, The Sublime Attitudes A Study Guide on the" opf:role="aut">The Sublime Attitudes A Study Guide on the Brahmavihāras</dc:creator>
